{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"首先落在左上方第一块白色与紫色的大号标题，随后视线被中部第二块白色与蓝色的大号标题吸引。两块字号、亮度和强调程度接近，形成两个主视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"仍在为过去受过的委屈和不甘较劲，后来逐渐耗尽力气，也意识到自己如今已经不在那些人身边。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不甘、疲惫、难受；不服气逐渐淡去，最后剩下难受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"中间小字对双影、低声说话、委屈和旧日记忆的具体描写；旧日记可能指向某个人、故乡或过去生活的多重可能性；下方关于旋律、节奏和呼吸变化的细节；右上角的阶段目录。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大标题都很显眼，争夺主视线，需要在两块之间切换。\",\n    \"核心情绪变化分散在两块标题里，需要把前面的不服气和后面的力竭、难受拼起来，才能理解完整关系。\",\n    \"两块主标题本身都较长，内部包含转折和多层意思，不能只凭放大的关键词完整还原处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e18cd0d9-e742-4dbc-9a6d-0b75971a0df9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013321444061Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:33:55.521762+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a8039be741fa6e4cfa45b4267dcf731df007a1aaf42a5659faa8f23187ab34ad", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4a